"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"clitic of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic of question"}],"gloss":"will he?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மழை","parts":[{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain"},{"surface":"கழூஉ","parts":[{"text":"கழூஉ","lemma":"கழுவு","gloss":"having washed"}],"gloss":"having washed"},{"surface":"மறந்த","parts":[{"text":"மறந்த","lemma":"மற","gloss":"forgotten"}],"gloss":"forgotten"},{"surface":"மா","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"இரும்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்","gloss":"dark"}],"gloss":"dark"},{"surface":"துறுகல்","parts":[{"text":"துறுகல்","lemma":"துறுகல்","gloss":"boulder"}],"gloss":"boulder"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துகள்","parts":[{"text":"துகள்","lemma":"துகள்","gloss":"dust"}],"gloss":"dust"},{"surface":"சூழ்","parts":[{"text":"சூழ்","lemma":"சூழ்","gloss":"surrounded"}],"gloss":"surrounded"},{"surface":"யானையின்","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like an elephant"},{"surface":"பொலிய","parts":[{"text":"பொலி","lemma":"பொலி","gloss":"to look splendid"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to look splendid"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றும்","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appearing"}],"gloss":"appearing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரும்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்","gloss":"dark"}],"gloss":"dark"},{"surface":"பல்","parts":[{"text":"பல்","lemma":"பல்","gloss":"many"}],"gloss":"many"},{"surface":"குன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"குன்றம்","lemma":"குன்றம்","gloss":"hill"}],"gloss":"hills"},{"surface":"போகி","parts":[{"text":"போகி","lemma":"போ","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திருந்திறை","parts":[{"text":"திருந்து","lemma":"திருந்து","gloss":"well-formed"},{"text":"இறை","lemma":"இறை","gloss":"joints"}],"gloss":"well-formed forearms"},{"surface":"பணைத்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"பணை","gloss":"bamboo"},{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"shoulders"}],"gloss":"bamboo-like shoulders"},{"surface":"உள்ளாதோரே","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளாதோர்","lemma":"உள்ளுதல்","gloss":"those who do not think of"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed those who do not think of"}]}],"literal":"Curved-horned buffalo of dark-colored blackness, / with clear-sounding bells with wide-open mouths tied to their striped necks, / which sound whenever they move in the lonely midnight, / even when it becomes this time, will he not come? / The great dark boulder which has forgotten being washed by rain, / appearing splendid like an elephant surrounded by dust, / having gone past many dark hills, / indeed, he who does not think of my bamboo-like shoulders with well-formed forearms.","translation":"The dark-colored, black buffaloes with curved horns have clear-sounding, wide-mouthed bells tied to their striped necks, which ring whenever they move in the lonely midnight. Even when this hour has arrived, will he not return? He has gone past many dark hills where great dark boulders, long unwashed by rain, look like splendid elephants covered in dust, and he does not think of my bamboo-like shoulders with well-formed forearms.","modern":"வளைந்த கொம்புகளையும் இருண்ட நிறத்தையும் உடைய கரிய எருமைகளின் வரிகளையுடைய கழுத்தில் கட்டப்பட்ட, அகன்ற வாயைக் கொண்ட தெளிந்த ஓசையுடைய மணிகள், தனிமை நிறைந்த நள்ளிரவில் அவை அசையும் போதெல்லாம் ஒலிக்கின்றன. இந்த நள்ளிரவுப் பொழுது வந்த பிறகும் அவர் வரமாட்டாரோ? மழையினால் கழுவப்படுவதை மறந்து, புழுதி சூழ்ந்த யானையைப் போலப் பொலிவுடன் தோன்றும் பெரிய கரிய பாறைகளைக் கொண்ட பல இருண்ட மலைகளைக் கடந்து சென்றவர், அழகிய முன்கைகளையும் மூங்கில் போன்ற தோள்களையும் உடைய என்னை நினைக்காமல் இருக்கிறாரே!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her confidante during the rainy season, which was the agreed time for the hero's return. She laments that even though the lonely midnight has arrived, marked by the ringing of bells on the returning buffaloes, her lover has not yet come back. The imagery of the dark boulders, unwashed by rain and looking like dust-covered elephants, represents the dry, difficult hilly terrain the hero has crossed. These visual and auditory cues intensify her feelings of separation, which is characteristic of the Mullai (forest) landscape. The key contrast lies between the returning herds that bring comfort to the village and the hero who remains far away, neglecting her beauty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.07,1.2],[1.4,1.8],[1.96,2.27],[2.27,2.74],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,4.1],[4.1,4.1],[4.1,4.1],[4.1,6.2],[6.2,7.22],[7.22,7.6],[7.6,10.3],[10.3,10.37],[10.37,10.37],[10.37,10.37],[10.37,10.57],[10.57,10.63],[10.63,11.77],[11.77,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.3],[13.3,14.2],[14.2,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,14.9],[14.9,16.4],[16.52,16.63],[16.63,16.98]],"female":[[0.0,0.45],[0.6,1.0],[1.07,1.2],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.27],[2.5,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,3.9],[3.9,5.47],[5.47,6.1],[6.1,6.1],[6.1,8.15],[8.15,8.6],[8.6,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.4,10.53],[10.53,10.91],[10.91,10.91],[10.91,11.29],[11.29,13.04],[13.1,13.8],[13.8,14.3],[14.3,14.4],[14.4,15.6],[15.6,15.8],[15.8,16.75],[16.75,16.75],[16.75,18.1],[18.1,18.43],[18.43,18.52]]}}